sn35.243:5.19 starts: It is in this way, friends, that one is corrupted.
sn35.243:7.16 starts: He overwhelms mental phenomena; mental phenomena do not overwhelm him.
sn35.243:7.17 starts: This is called, friends, a bhikkhu who overwhelms forms,
an8.12:18.5 starts: It is in this way that one could rightly say of me:
an8.12:27.7 starts: Only what is given to me is very fruitful,
an8.12:32.3 starts: a number of Nigaṇṭhas are going from street to street
